  {
   "id": "u1442",
   "en": "A rookie who has dreamed of being a pilot since childhood.\nHonest and earnest; a little timid, but shows a bold side\nonce fired up. (CV: Jun Konno)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Player pilot profile (Male Pilot A slot). Hard 3-line row, no pronouns (player)."
  },
  {
   "id": "u1443",
   "en": "Raised wealthy, wanting for nothing, but bored of a thrill-free\nlife, so became a pilot. A veteran of many battlefields; foul-mouthed,\nbut adored as a good big brother. (CV: Tetsu Inada)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Player pilot profile (Male Pilot B slot). 'big brother' is in the source."
  },
  {
   "id": "u1444",
   "en": "Born into a military family where service is mandatory, and a\nrare female pilot even among them. Cheerful and friendly with\nboth men and women, which men often misread. (CV: Hinako Sasaki)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Player pilot profile (Female Pilot A slot). 'female pilot' is in the source; no pronouns added."
  },
  {
   "id": "u1445",
